  "content": "<p><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/uKZEWLR.png\" alt=\"Pack Banner\" width=\"700\" height=\"450\"></strong></p>\n<p><strong><a href=\"https://discord.gg/J9jY4Z6\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/YeQZceJ.png\" alt=\"Discord Badge\" width=\"233\" height=\"76\"></a><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Dr_prof_Luigi\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/24auqwO.png\" alt=\"Patreon Badge\" width=\"234\" height=\"76\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/the-end-of-minecraft\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Om4BpzM.png\" alt=\"TEOM Badge\" width=\"233\" height=\"76\"></a></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;<strong><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/unu-parts-pack\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/d51JHWL.png\" alt=\"This Pack uses Quality UNU Parts\" width=\"700\" height=\"120\"></a></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;<br><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/lCmsctToQt0?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>本模组需要以下前置条件：</strong></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/minecraft-transport-simulator\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft Transport Simulator</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/unu-parts-pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">UNU Parts Pack</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-railroading\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Immersive Railroading (可选)*</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>下载我的其他整合包！</strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/unu-civilian-pack-for-mts\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><br></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/unu-civilian-pack-for-mts\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">UNU Civilian - 来自 UNU 的优质民用汽车、卡车、飞机和火车！</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mts-air-cooled-vehicles-pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MTS Air-Cooled Pack - 大众、科尔维拉及其他风冷汽车！</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/expanded-unuverse-pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Expanded UNUverse Pack - 来自 BlackThorne 之外的 UNUverse 的车辆！</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/iconic-movie-vehicles-pack-mts\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Iconic Film Vehicles - 2015年经典影片车辆<br><br></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/fallout-mc\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>尝试官方服务器！</strong></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><br><br>所有车辆均提供黑索蓝配色，以及沙漠、森林和冬季迷彩涂装。<br><br>车辆列表：<br>UNU Wolf [NR-490-LTG]<br>UNU Mule [ZF-174-MCG] - 多种配置<br><br>如果您安装了 Immersive Railroading*，您还将获得一把巨型火车炮**。<br><br>更多车辆即将推出！<br><br>*如果您将 .jar 文件后缀改为 .zip，则可以将其作为 IR 资源包使用，无需安装 MTS<br><br>**火车炮目前尚无法操作，但我要是敢保证它不会让所有见到它的人感到敬畏，我就天打雷劈。</p>",
